ci: add a workflow for building external repositories

What:
A second workflow that checks out a named repository at a named ref and times a
container build of it, recording the commit actually built.

Why:
The heavyweight comparison targets are large upstream projects. Vendoring them
here would be unmanageable and would drift from upstream; pointing a workflow at
them keeps the fixture set small and the comparison honest.

Notes:
- Same scope as the existing workflow: the build phase only.
- The built commit is recorded as an artifact, because a branch ref moves and a
  rerun months later would otherwise not be comparable.
